  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s aims are:&#x2022;	Sensitising policymakers of the Iranian central government and key officers of state-owned companies to Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR).&#x2022;	Increasing their knowledge and sensitising them on how (Dutch) companies are implementing CSR standards and how an understanding the CSR requirements of (Dutch) businesses could improve the ease of doing international business with Iran.</narrative>
